==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s (200%) spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge]]s (200%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s (200%) spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Cyber Pretty Cat (Enemy)|Cyber Pretty Cats]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

